1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,240
"This kurta again?

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,960
Wore it last wedding too?"

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,570
Bua said it so loudly…

4
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,280
Tanvi felt everyone heard.

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,210
Rest of the evening?

6
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,610
Behind the dessert counter.

7
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:10,910
A hundred guests…

8
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,680
Every eye on her kurta.

9
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,990
Or so she felt.

10
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,400
Really? A famous study:

11
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,990
students walked into a room

12
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,730
in an embarrassing T-shirt.

13
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,980
Their guess: half would notice.

14
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,930
Reality? About a quarter.

15
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,290
The spotlight effect…

16
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,600
The stage light feels

17
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,060
like it's only on us.

18
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:28,410
People notice far less…

19
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:29,820
Everyone stands in their

20
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,790
own spotlight.

21
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,660
The Gita:

22
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,840
Equal to friend and foe,

23
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,020
in honour and dishonour.

24
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,900
Steady, either way.

25
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:38,700
So Tanvi smiled:

26
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,020
"Yes Bua, it's my favourite.

27
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,500
So I wore it again."

28
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:42,130
Your call:

29
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:44,010
Same kurta next function…

30
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:44,930
or a new one?
